[en.EVENT_CMC_UPRISE_1]
Breaking News: CMC Uprise

[en.EVENT_CMC_UPRISE_1_desc]
In a stunning turn of events, the Cutie Mark Crusaders, led by the determined trio of Apple Bloom, Scootaloo, and Sweetie Belle, have risen up against the iron-hoof rule of Empress Cozy Glow.
Claimed to be frustrated by the oppressive regime, the Crusaders have taken it upon themselves, as well as many ponies who would like to follow, to restore harmony, freedom, and the pursuit of happiness throughout Equestria.
Empress Cozy Glow, who has just returned from her “working vaction”, has yet to make a public statement herself. Meanwhile the spokespony of the Ministry of Order has issued a statement, calling the crusaders “mistakenly view the enlightened policies made by our brilliant and benevolent ruler of Equestria as oppressive”.
As the conflict escalates, tensions rise, and the stakes grow higher. The Ministry of Order and Ministry of Defence have announced that the Empire is entering a state of emergency, and curfews will be imposed in all major cities until the rebellion is quelled.
The future of Equestria is uncertain, and the world is watching.

[en.EVENT_CMC_UPRISE_1_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_CMC_UPRISE_2]
CMC Uprise!

[en.EVENT_CMC_UPRISE_2_desc]
Commrades, today we have great news to share. Our invisible ally, the Cutie Mark Crusaders, have officially risen up in the southwest against the illegal empire! They have taken the castle named after our mentor, Twilight Sparkle, and are now advancing towards Canterlot. Although the Cutie Mark Crusaders are just a revolutionary group formed by three foals, they have the spirit of pursuing a harmonious Equestria with freedom and equality. From now on, we will unconditionally support the Cutie Mark Crusaders. The days of the illegal empire are numbered, and Equestria will be reborn!

[en.EVENT_CMC_UPRISE_2_o0]
Revolution!

[en.EVENT_CMC_UPRISE_3]
Internal Speech of Empress Cozy Glow

[en.EVENT_CMC_UPRISE_3_desc]
After learning about the cute mark crusaders’ uprising, Empress Cozy Glow made a calm and elegant internal speech to the Ministry of Defence in the palace this morning:
“Damn the cute mark crusaders, they dare to deceive the ponies with their lies, they are accomplices of Starlight! The cute mark crusaders, like Starlight, are also promoting so-called freedom, liberation and democracy. They are really self-contradictory, they deceive the ponies with these sweet words, just to show off their so-called cute mark. But we will not let their conspiracy succeed, from now on, the cute mark crusaders are officially recognized as a terrorist organization, and they shall be crushed by our iron hooves!”
Now, all departments are ordered to spread this speech to the grassroots soldiers, and collect learning notes and military pledges to submit to Empire central, in order to more effectively strike the cute mark crusaders with higher intensity and requirements.

[en.EVENT_CMC_UPRISE_3_o0]
Yes, Your Highness!

[zh.EVENT_CMC_UPRISE_1]
突发新闻：可爱标志童子军起义

[zh.EVENT_CMC_UPRISE_1_desc]
在令人震惊的事件中，由小萍花、滑板璐和甜贝儿领导的可爱标志童子军，发动了一场起义来反抗女皇和煦光流的铁蹄统治。
童子军们称，他们对压迫性政权感到沮丧，他们与许多愿意跟随的小马以及决定，恢复整个小马利亚的和谐、自由和对幸福的追求。
女皇和煦光流刚刚从她的“工作假期”中回来，她还没有发表任何公开声明。与此同时，秩序部的发言者发表了一份声明，称童子军“错误地认为我们伟大而仁慈的小马利亚统治者所制定的开明政策是压迫性的”。
随着冲突升级，紧张局势升级，风险变得更高。秩序部和国防部宣布，帝国将进入紧急状态，并将在所有主要城市实施宵禁，直到叛乱被镇压。
小马利亚的未来充满变数，世界正在关注。

[zh.EVENT_CMC_UPRISE_1_o0]
好吧

[zh.EVENT_CMC_UPRISE_2]
可爱标志童子军起义！

[zh.EVENT_CMC_UPRISE_2_desc]
同志们，告诉大家一个好消息。今天，我们的隐形盟友——可爱标记童子军在伪帝国西南方向正式起义！她们已经拿下了以我们的导师——暮光闪闪的名字命名的城堡，现在正在朝坎特洛特方向前进。虽然可爱标记童子军仅仅是由三只幼驹组建起来的革命团体，但她们有着追求一个自由平等的小马利亚的谐律精神。从现在起，我们将无条件援助可爱标记童子军，伪帝国灭亡的日子不远了，小马利亚将会迎来新生！

[zh.EVENT_CMC_UPRISE_2_o0]
革命万岁！

[zh.EVENT_CMC_UPRISE_3]
和煦光流女皇的内部讲话

[zh.EVENT_CMC_UPRISE_3_desc]
在得知可爱标志童子军起义的消息后，和煦光流女皇于今日上午在皇宫内对帝国国防部发表了一场冷静而优雅的讲话：
“该死的可爱标记童子军，她们竟敢对小马们妖言惑众，她们是星光熠熠的共犯！可爱标记童子军和星光一样也在宣传着所谓的自由，解放和民主。她们可真会自相矛盾，她们用这些花言巧语欺骗小马，只是为了炫耀他们那所谓华而不实的可爱标记。但是我们不会让她们的阴谋得逞的，从现在开始，可爱标记童子军就是恐怖主义组织，她们将会被我们的铁蹄碾碎！”
现命令各级部门将这段讲话向基层士兵传播，并收集学习笔记和军令状上交帝国中央，以更高的力度和要求对可爱标记童子军进行更有效的打击。

[zh.EVENT_CMC_UPRISE_3_o0]
女皇万岁！
